<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<%- include('partials/head', { title: '활동 로그 - 관리자' }) %>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap-wide">
    <div class="brand">
      <span class="dot">C</span>
      <span class="name">발신 번호 등록 관리자</span>
      <span class="sub">발신번호 등록 · 관리자</span>
      <span class="userbar">
        <span class="who"><%= currentUser ? currentUser.name : '' %></span>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" href="/admin">← 대시보드</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" href="/admin/members">담당자별 통계</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" href="/auth/logout">로그아웃</a>
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:16px;">
      <p class="eyebrow">활동 로그</p>
      <% if (typeof filterUser !== 'undefined' && filterUser) { %>
        <h1 class="title" style="font-size:19px;"><%= (entries[0] && entries[0].user_name) || filterUser %> 님의 활동</h1>
        <p class="lead"><%= filterUser %> · 최근 300건 <a href="/admin/activity" style="margin-left:8px;">전체 보기 →</a></p>
      <% } else { %>
        <h1 class="title" style="font-size:19px;">누가 · 언제 · 무엇을</h1>
        <p class="lead">건별 작업 내역입니다. 최근 300건까지 표시됩니다.</p>
      <% } %>
    </div>

    <div class="table-card">
      <% if (!entries || entries.length === 0) { %>
        <div class="empty">아직 기록된 활동이 없어요.</div>
      <% } else { %>
        <table class="alog">
          <thead>
            <tr><th>시각</th><th>담당자</th><th>작업</th><th>매장</th><th>비고</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <% entries.forEach(function (e) { %>
              <tr>
                <td class="t"><%= e.created_at %></td>
                <td class="u"><%= e.user_name || e.user_email || '-' %></td>
                <td><span class="act-pill"><%= e.action %></span></td>
                <td><%= e.store_name || '-' %></td>
                <td style="color:var(--muted);"><%= e.detail || '' %></td>
              </tr>
            <% }) %>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      <% } %>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
